---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Dario Picozzi">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Dario Picozzi</h1>
      <p>
        I am an EPSRC Postdoctoral Prize Fellow in the Department of Physics and Astronomy at
        University College London (UCL). Previously, I held an EPSRC Research Fellowship at the
        London Centre for Nanotechnology. My work sits at the intersection of geometry, physics
        and information. It spans quantum computing, where I have worked on quantum algorithms,
        quantum circuits and symmetry-adapted encodings to simulate physical processes, for
        instance molecular electronic structure and electron–molecule scattering; the
        information geometry of machine learning; and theoretical physics, including quantum
        gravity, holography and foundational questions.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside academia, I am co-founder and managing director of{' '}
        <a href="https://tanuki.ai">Tanuki</a>, an AI-powered computational simulation platform
        for science and engineering. Through Tanuki, we contribute the simulation of sea-ice
        mechanics to Re-thickening Arctic Sea Ice (RASI), an ARIA-funded, University of
        Cambridge-led programme researching whether Arctic sea ice can be re-thickened to slow
        its loss.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: calc(100dvh - 9rem);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 6vh, 4.5rem);
    padding-inline: 1.25rem;
  }
  .card {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0.15em 0 0.6em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .card { padding: 1.6rem 1.35rem; }
  }
</style>
